{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39927","headline":"忆潼关早行 · 徐夤","name":"忆潼关早行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行客起看仙掌月，落星斜照浊河泥。\n故山远处高飞雁，去马鸣时先早鸡。\n关柳不知谁氏种，岳碑犹见圣君题。\n蒭荛十轴僮三尺，岂谓青云便有梯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39927.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39927","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}